00:00:37.134 --> 00:00:38.904
Say, wanna get some tea?

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:41.634
The tart cake they serve at
that new place is so good!

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:44.164
Fine with me. You coming too, Naomi?

00:00:46.274 --> 00:00:47.744
Naomi?

00:00:47.874 --> 00:00:50.244
Sorry, I have to pass on that today.

00:00:50.244 --> 00:00:51.614
See you tomorrow!

