00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:00.504
36th sense: "No Boys Allowed!
The Angel's Afternoon"

00:03:02.684 --> 00:03:05.984
God! I can't do this homework!

00:03:05.984 --> 00:03:07.654
We've been on standby forever!

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:10.514
Can't something happen so we can
go out and blow off some steam?!

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:15.154
Come on, if we're not going out,
it just means the world's at peace.

00:03:15.154 --> 00:03:17.364
Exactly. Peace is best.

00:03:17.364 --> 00:03:21.394
Just being able to do our
homework is fine with me.

00:03:21.394 --> 00:03:22.494
Exactly, Kaoru.

00:03:22.804 --> 00:03:24.364
You should be happy to not have

00:03:24.364 --> 00:03:27.134
any special esper duty instead
of complaining about it.

00:03:31.874 --> 00:03:34.504
Naomi's been acting weird lately.

00:03:35.314 --> 00:03:38.374
Yeah! Not having to work is a good thing!

00:03:38.614 --> 00:03:41.384
Okay, let's finish our homework
fast and play some games!

00:03:41.514 --> 00:03:43.884
Finish your homework correctly.

00:03:43.884 --> 00:03:45.124
Okay!

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:47.654
I said, Naomi's been acting weird lately!

00:03:47.654 --> 00:03:51.264
How can I finish my homework when I'm
thinking of all the fun I'll have later?

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:54.534
Aren't you just going to copy
our answers, Kaoru?

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:56.104
If you say that, it's all over.

00:03:56.104 --> 00:03:58.194
Come on! Let's see that hand moving!

00:03:59.134 --> 00:04:02.334
Naomi! My Naomi!

00:04:03.174 --> 00:04:04.234
Right, right...

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:08.414
What have you done this time,
Supervisor Tanizaki?

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:11.414
How rude! I haven't done anything!

00:04:11.414 --> 00:04:14.054
Since Naomi's been coming home
late for the last few days,

00:04:14.054 --> 00:04:16.454
I got worried and followed
her to see what was up!

00:04:16.954 --> 00:04:18.284
I know...

00:04:18.354 --> 00:04:21.014
That's when I took this photo.

00:04:21.724 --> 00:04:23.314
Nice shot, huh?

00:04:23.824 --> 00:04:25.194
Oops, wrong one.

00:04:25.194 --> 00:04:25.954
These!

00:04:28.164 --> 00:04:29.134
What are?!

00:04:30.404 --> 00:04:33.734
These are giving me a funny feeling inside!

00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:35.004
What's this?!

00:04:35.004 --> 00:04:37.374
This feeling in my heart I've never felt before?

00:04:37.374 --> 00:04:41.674
That's it! I sense the vibrations of
the creepy old guys of the world!

00:04:42.984 --> 00:04:44.844
There's no such thing.

00:04:45.144 --> 00:04:48.514
Maybe Naomi's been disillusioned with men.

00:04:48.514 --> 00:04:50.714
Which would definitely be your
fault, Supervisor Tanizaki.

00:04:51.854 --> 00:04:54.754
Who's the woman with Naomi?

00:04:55.154 --> 00:04:58.694
Miss Ruriko Shinju, the art
teacher at Naomi's school.

00:04:58.694 --> 00:05:00.364
She's beautiful.

00:05:00.364 --> 00:05:03.624
Naomi spends all her time with
her when she's not at BABEL.

00:05:03.864 --> 00:05:05.904
Wow. They're always together?

00:05:05.904 --> 00:05:07.924
Which means...

00:05:09.134 --> 00:05:10.544
Cut that out!

00:05:10.544 --> 00:05:13.114
Find out what this is about!

00:05:13.114 --> 00:05:17.084
My Naomi may have been
led astray by that woman!

00:05:17.084 --> 00:05:19.314
Please! I beg of you!

00:05:19.314 --> 00:05:21.584
Great... Haven't we done this before?

00:05:21.584 --> 00:05:22.444
Who cares?

00:05:22.924 --> 00:05:25.214
It sounds interesting, so let's check it out!

00:05:26.254 --> 00:05:29.624
We may just open the hitherto
unknown door to adulthood!

00:05:30.764 --> 00:05:33.334
What sort of door is the door to adulthood?

00:05:33.334 --> 00:05:34.264
Well...

00:05:34.264 --> 00:05:35.734
She doesn't have to know!

00:05:51.044 --> 00:05:53.574
Sorry to call you out on a Sunday again.

00:05:54.014 --> 00:05:56.584
Naomi's at that delicate age, huh?

00:05:56.584 --> 00:06:00.714
Oh, it makes my heart throb.
Sweet memories of first love!

00:06:01.154 --> 00:06:03.424
You have memories like that, too?

00:06:03.424 --> 00:06:04.914
Yes, I do!

00:06:05.024 --> 00:06:09.464
There was Hiroko. And Kirari.
And Noelle. And Kobeni.

00:06:09.904 --> 00:06:11.294
Those aren't first loves.

00:06:12.564 --> 00:06:13.904
Along with...

00:06:17.004 --> 00:06:18.034
You...

00:06:21.174 --> 00:06:23.184
Aya, Haruka, Ryoko, Masumi,
Ayumi, Rie, Eri, Rina,

00:06:23.184 --> 00:06:25.014
Jurouta, Angelina, Yuuko,
Aiko, Keiko, Jennifer...

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:26.274
You are such a...
Satomi, Machiko, Yumi, Kaoru, Nudelaid...

00:06:27.114 --> 00:06:29.554
Team C, moving to residence center.

00:06:29.554 --> 00:06:32.544
Target leaving Kuretake Ryo
will arrive at any moment!

00:06:32.754 --> 00:06:33.514
Roger.

00:06:36.224 --> 00:06:37.624
Miss!

00:06:40.394 --> 00:06:41.194
Naomi!

00:06:41.594 --> 00:06:46.134
Sorry for making you wait
after I invited you here.

00:06:46.134 --> 00:06:47.894
I just got here, as well.

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:57.444
Sorry. I always see you
in your uniform, so...

00:06:57.444 --> 00:06:58.714
It doesn't suit me?

00:06:58.714 --> 00:06:59.974
Far from it!

00:07:00.414 --> 00:07:03.354
It suits you perfectly.
You're very cute, Naomi.

00:07:05.584 --> 00:07:06.954
She sure is cute.

00:07:06.954 --> 00:07:08.044
And it does suit her well.

00:07:09.824 --> 00:07:12.394
God, guys really go for that?

00:07:12.394 --> 00:07:15.964
They see you clean up a little and they fall over.

00:07:15.964 --> 00:07:18.904
Strip off the veneer and every
woman's exactly the same!

00:07:18.904 --> 00:07:20.994
What are you fighting about?!

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:23.364
Okay Miss, let's go!

00:07:25.844 --> 00:07:27.744
That's Miss Shinju?

00:07:27.744 --> 00:07:29.474
Naomi must have invited her out.

00:07:30.044 --> 00:07:31.814
This has gotten interesting.

00:07:32.544 --> 00:07:33.674
I mean, let's follow them.

00:07:33.754 --> 00:07:35.374
MONA EXHIBIT

00:07:40.554 --> 00:07:42.654
What a lovely painting.

00:07:42.654 --> 00:07:43.314
Yes.

00:07:48.664 --> 00:07:49.564
Delicious!

00:07:59.204 --> 00:08:01.104
Please! Don't go!

00:08:04.084 --> 00:08:06.114
Well? Hands? Are they holding hands?!

00:08:06.114 --> 00:08:08.054
I can't really see from here.

00:08:08.054 --> 00:08:10.574
What about their thighs?
Are they stroking their thighs?!

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:12.924
I can't really see from here.

00:08:12.924 --> 00:08:15.824
Their thighs? Didn't they come to see the movie?

00:08:15.824 --> 00:08:17.994
You never know with adults.

00:08:17.994 --> 00:08:19.894
When you become an adult, Aoi...

00:08:19.894 --> 00:08:22.454
Ew! I don't want to be an adult like that!

00:08:22.864 --> 00:08:25.424
Art gallery. Restaurant. Movie theater.

00:08:25.504 --> 00:08:27.304
Definitely a date.

00:08:27.304 --> 00:08:30.794
Supervisor Tanizaki may be right to worry.

00:08:35.714 --> 00:08:37.844
This is Naomi's school.

00:08:37.844 --> 00:08:39.244
But it's Sunday.

00:08:39.244 --> 00:08:40.714
What did they come here for?

00:08:40.714 --> 00:08:41.344
Suspicious.

00:08:59.104 --> 00:09:00.274
The art room?

00:09:00.274 --> 00:09:01.664
What are they doing in there?

00:09:02.334 --> 00:09:04.474
Thank you for today, Naomi.

00:09:04.474 --> 00:09:06.464
No. Miss, there's still...

00:09:08.244 --> 00:09:08.974
Yes.

00:09:13.614 --> 00:09:18.414
Today's going to go well. I have a feeling.

00:09:18.854 --> 00:09:20.954
Go well how, exactly?

00:09:20.954 --> 00:09:22.054
I can't see!

00:09:22.054 --> 00:09:24.324
May I lie down?

00:09:24.324 --> 00:09:24.964
Yes.

00:09:24.964 --> 00:09:25.994
Lie down?

00:09:25.994 --> 00:09:26.754
What's going on?

00:09:27.494 --> 00:09:29.554
Naomi's being assertive.

00:09:31.064 --> 00:09:32.634
It's locked.

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:34.404
That's kind of suspicious, huh?

00:09:34.404 --> 00:09:35.834
What are they doing in there?

00:09:35.834 --> 00:09:38.934
Relax a little more. There.

00:09:39.814 --> 00:09:41.974
Oh... I can't take it anymore!

00:09:41.974 --> 00:09:42.704
Kaoru!

00:09:53.094 --> 00:09:55.224
Kaoru! What are you doing here?!

00:09:55.224 --> 00:09:56.124
Shut up!

00:09:56.124 --> 00:09:58.924
Why are you still dressed?!
I was really looking forward to this!

00:09:59.464 --> 00:10:01.064
Why are you angry?

00:10:01.064 --> 00:10:03.964
You betrayed an innocent girl's expectations!

00:10:03.964 --> 00:10:05.604
Who's the innocent girl?

00:10:05.604 --> 00:10:06.834
Pardon the intrusion!

00:10:07.304 --> 00:10:08.434
Who are you?

00:10:08.434 --> 00:10:09.804
Just passing by!

00:10:11.474 --> 00:10:14.064
Um... My coworkers.

00:10:14.474 --> 00:10:15.344
Coworkers?

00:10:15.944 --> 00:10:17.434
Oh, so you're espers, too?

00:10:17.884 --> 00:10:20.984
And, by that, you mean...
You know about Naomi?

00:10:20.984 --> 00:10:21.744
I do.

00:10:22.214 --> 00:10:25.584
That's why Naomi's helping me.

00:10:27.354 --> 00:10:28.494
Help?

00:10:28.494 --> 00:10:30.764
Basically... That's right.

00:10:30.764 --> 00:10:33.034
It'd be quicker to just show you the painting.

00:10:33.034 --> 00:10:34.894
I painted it with Naomi as the model.

00:10:35.564 --> 00:10:38.364
You mean... A nude of Naomi?!

00:10:38.364 --> 00:10:39.734
Why nude?

00:10:42.234 --> 00:10:45.034
Huh? What is this?

00:10:45.574 --> 00:10:47.274
Is it from some girl's comic?

00:10:47.274 --> 00:10:50.174
How is this Naomi?

00:10:54.384 --> 00:10:56.874
Naughty! Naughty!

00:10:59.484 --> 00:11:01.854
I love daikon.

00:11:04.894 --> 00:11:07.764
Forgive me. I didn't just involve Naomi.

00:11:07.764 --> 00:11:10.164
Now I've involved all of you from BABEL.

00:11:10.164 --> 00:11:11.864
No, don't worry about it.

00:11:12.364 --> 00:11:15.404
Anyway, can you just give us the details?

00:11:15.404 --> 00:11:16.094
Right.

00:11:16.604 --> 00:11:18.904
There's an art contest coming up.

00:11:18.904 --> 00:11:22.014
I was working on a painting as my entry,

00:11:22.014 --> 00:11:24.644
but no matter what model I draw,
my hand moves by itself.

00:11:25.214 --> 00:11:28.344
It's almost like it's being moved
by an invisible force.

00:11:30.354 --> 00:11:32.254
This is the painting that resulted.

00:11:34.754 --> 00:11:36.724
I became distraught, and then...

00:11:39.624 --> 00:11:40.454
Miss?

00:11:46.634 --> 00:11:47.704
Naomi?

00:11:47.704 --> 00:11:50.404
Is there anything I can do to help?

00:11:51.644 --> 00:11:55.944
You know I'm a special esper, right?

00:11:56.344 --> 00:11:59.014
Yes, I do, but...

00:11:59.014 --> 00:12:04.354
If your hand is moving by itself,
an esper might be behind it.

00:12:04.954 --> 00:12:07.324
I might be able to discover a clue.

00:12:09.794 --> 00:12:14.864
Thank you, but... I can't ask
you to trouble yourself.

00:12:14.864 --> 00:12:16.134
You have your work at BABEL.

00:12:16.134 --> 00:12:17.034
I don't care!

00:12:17.664 --> 00:12:20.964
I've always respected your work!

00:12:23.304 --> 00:12:25.944
You always paint such beautiful pictures.

00:12:25.944 --> 00:12:29.574
And always teach us with such
kindness. That's why...

00:12:30.044 --> 00:12:32.534
I just want to help you in any way that I can!

00:12:32.984 --> 00:12:34.104
Naomi...

00:12:34.884 --> 00:12:38.944
And so Naomi went to work to
find the cause of my problem.

00:12:39.754 --> 00:12:43.214
Of course, she also appealed to
me as a model for my painting.

00:12:43.624 --> 00:12:46.184
No, please. I'm not that appealing.

00:12:51.564 --> 00:12:52.864
It's true.

00:12:52.864 --> 00:12:53.834
Miss...

00:12:54.174 --> 00:12:56.294
So, that's what this was about!

00:12:57.504 --> 00:12:59.234
But, if she was modeling for your painting...

00:12:59.574 --> 00:13:01.064
What's with these photos?

00:13:01.144 --> 00:13:01.974
Those are!

00:13:01.974 --> 00:13:03.684
Supervisor Tanizaki took them.

00:13:03.684 --> 00:13:06.774
He saw what he wanted to
see in your relationship.

00:13:08.054 --> 00:13:11.114
That idiot! How dare he take
pictures of me again!

00:13:13.394 --> 00:13:14.854
GO TO HELL!

00:13:15.154 --> 00:13:16.814
What the hell?!

00:13:18.194 --> 00:13:19.564
Dark... So dark...

00:13:25.764 --> 00:13:26.964
It's all a misunderstanding.

00:13:27.504 --> 00:13:31.474
This one was when I tripped and
Miss Shinju caught me.

00:13:31.474 --> 00:13:34.734
This one was when she was getting
a speck out of my eye.

00:13:35.244 --> 00:13:36.214
You see?

00:13:36.214 --> 00:13:37.244
Oh...

00:13:37.244 --> 00:13:38.474
What about that date you had today?

00:13:40.184 --> 00:13:41.614
Date?

00:13:41.614 --> 00:13:43.454
We've just been checking here at school.

00:13:43.454 --> 00:13:46.684
I thought I might find a clue
if we changed locations.

00:13:47.154 --> 00:13:48.554
But, in the end...

00:13:48.554 --> 00:13:49.654
Don't worry about it.

00:13:50.494 --> 00:13:52.824
It was a good effort.

00:13:53.764 --> 00:13:54.824
Miss...

00:13:55.564 --> 00:13:57.654
So, that's what this is about!

00:13:59.334 --> 00:14:01.604
Okay, in that case, leave this to us!

00:14:02.534 --> 00:14:05.244
Right. We'll help you, too.

00:14:05.244 --> 00:14:06.814
Let's find the cause of this.

00:14:06.814 --> 00:14:09.844
But, aren't you busy with other things?

00:14:09.844 --> 00:14:12.714
That's all right. Please leave this to BABEL.

00:14:14.084 --> 00:14:16.784
Sorry for the trouble. By all means.

00:14:17.584 --> 00:14:19.614
Oh, this is about Naomi?

00:14:19.894 --> 00:14:23.024
Right, and Supervisor Tanizaki
was really worried about her.

00:14:23.024 --> 00:14:27.864
But with that creep always around her,
she's going to end up really hating men.

00:14:28.194 --> 00:14:31.094
And some guys are drawn to girls
who don't want to look at them.

00:14:31.464 --> 00:14:36.034
Mind-readers like us are used
to always being stared at.

00:14:36.034 --> 00:14:36.944
That's right.

00:14:36.944 --> 00:14:40.804
When our ESP awoke in puberty,
we were shocked at first.

00:14:40.874 --> 00:14:41.934
But we got used to it.

00:14:42.374 --> 00:14:44.504
Why didn't you end up hating men?

00:14:44.884 --> 00:14:48.004
People are all dirty. And in that case...

00:14:48.484 --> 00:14:52.444
I prefer dirty men to dirty women.

00:14:52.784 --> 00:14:54.414
That's... deep...

00:14:55.154 --> 00:14:56.784
Let's begin this strategy meeting!

00:15:04.264 --> 00:15:09.904
So, we want to lure Esper X to
Miss Shinju's condo, then?

00:15:09.904 --> 00:15:10.804
Right.

00:15:10.804 --> 00:15:12.534
Why her condo?

00:15:13.044 --> 00:15:17.674
Because Naomi doesn't want the other
students to know she's a special esper.

00:15:17.744 --> 00:15:22.884
Right. The teachers know, but it'd
be best if the students didn't.

00:15:22.884 --> 00:15:26.184
All right then, we commence the
operation tomorrow, after school.

00:15:26.184 --> 00:15:26.784
Roger!

00:15:27.754 --> 00:15:29.484
Please don't worry.

00:15:29.924 --> 00:15:31.864
I promise, we'll take care of this.

00:15:39.064 --> 00:15:42.524
W-Wait a sec. I'll make us a drink.

00:15:42.874 --> 00:15:45.144
Do you like coffee? Or maybe some black tea?

00:15:45.144 --> 00:15:46.194
Black tea, please?

00:15:46.274 --> 00:15:48.364
Black tea? I'll make that, then.

00:15:50.344 --> 00:15:51.344
Miss!

00:15:51.344 --> 00:15:55.114
Oh, look at me. What am I so nervous about?

00:16:15.134 --> 00:16:18.734
You're involved with such
interesting people, Naomi.

00:16:19.004 --> 00:16:21.704
Yeah, that's right. There's always
something happening.

00:16:22.244 --> 00:16:26.084
The Children and that supervisor...
Mr. Tanizaki, right?

00:16:26.084 --> 00:16:26.634
Yes.

00:16:26.914 --> 00:16:28.144
What's he like?

00:16:29.114 --> 00:16:30.344
He's very nice.

00:16:31.454 --> 00:16:35.154
He's tried his best to raise
me well since I was small.

00:16:35.654 --> 00:16:39.494
I'm able to attend high school, thanks to him.

00:16:39.494 --> 00:16:40.864
That's high praise.

00:16:41.434 --> 00:16:45.064
By any chance... Are you two involved?

00:16:45.064 --> 00:16:46.734
As in, are we lovers?

00:16:46.734 --> 00:16:47.604
Y-Yes...

00:16:48.974 --> 00:16:51.244
1000% not.

00:16:51.244 --> 00:16:52.844
Y-You don't say...

00:16:52.844 --> 00:16:54.004
But...

00:16:54.644 --> 00:17:00.484
I wonder when my Prince Charming
will finally appear.

00:17:03.214 --> 00:17:04.554
Miss?

00:17:05.054 --> 00:17:07.484
Naomi, I...

00:17:10.664 --> 00:17:12.464
Esper wave, detected!

00:17:12.464 --> 00:17:13.754
In the rear of the condo!

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:16.154
Miss!

00:17:16.594 --> 00:17:19.194
Looks like Esper X figured out the trap.

00:17:20.374 --> 00:17:23.274
Special espers The Children, move out!

00:17:23.274 --> 00:17:23.964
Roger!

00:17:24.504 --> 00:17:26.274
Children, released!

00:17:26.774 --> 00:17:28.774
Every child is an artist!

00:17:28.774 --> 00:17:31.384
The problem is how to remain an artist...

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:33.504
...once we grow up. By Pablo Picasso!

00:17:34.284 --> 00:17:35.754
Art is an explosion!

00:17:35.754 --> 00:17:38.384
Special espers the Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:17:42.094 --> 00:17:43.094
What was that?

00:17:43.094 --> 00:17:43.824
A horse?

00:17:43.824 --> 00:17:44.814
Get it!

00:17:50.834 --> 00:17:53.464
Who are you shady characters?!

00:17:54.204 --> 00:17:56.074
You're one to talk!

00:17:56.074 --> 00:17:56.804
Isn't he?

00:17:56.804 --> 00:17:57.834
From the painting!

00:18:00.074 --> 00:18:00.774
Hold it!

00:18:05.744 --> 00:18:07.614
Who are these pursuers?

00:18:07.614 --> 00:18:08.674
Stop!

00:18:10.584 --> 00:18:14.284
Have you come to interfere with the love
she and I share?! I won't allow it!

00:18:15.594 --> 00:18:19.394
Those who stand in the way of love
will feel my horse's hooves!

00:18:29.574 --> 00:18:31.834
What is this?

00:18:44.684 --> 00:18:45.584
This person...

00:18:45.584 --> 00:18:47.124
Do you know him?

00:18:47.124 --> 00:18:48.054
No.

00:18:48.124 --> 00:18:49.854
Naoya Kikuchi.

00:18:49.854 --> 00:18:52.594
Has the ability to affect the movements of others.

00:18:52.594 --> 00:18:53.854
Level 5 esper.

00:18:55.934 --> 00:18:58.094
Okay, I want the truth.

00:18:58.964 --> 00:18:59.624
Yes, sir.

00:19:04.574 --> 00:19:05.504
I love you!

00:19:06.774 --> 00:19:07.514
Hey!

00:19:07.514 --> 00:19:08.634
I love you!

00:19:08.914 --> 00:19:10.584
What are you talking about?!

00:19:10.584 --> 00:19:13.704
In town... I saw you in town!

00:19:13.784 --> 00:19:15.684
It was love at first sight!

00:19:21.994 --> 00:19:23.894
Thanks! Come again!

00:19:32.864 --> 00:19:33.664
See you.

00:19:37.744 --> 00:19:42.114
I began to pine for you. I only had eyes for you!

00:19:42.114 --> 00:19:42.914
But...

00:19:42.914 --> 00:19:44.584
All I could do was look.

00:19:44.584 --> 00:19:48.214
You had no idea I even existed!

00:19:48.484 --> 00:19:50.254
So, what then?

00:19:50.254 --> 00:19:53.024
He used his ESP on Miss Shinju

00:19:53.024 --> 00:19:56.284
to paint his picture so she'd learn about him.

00:19:57.564 --> 00:19:58.894
A type of imprinting.

00:19:59.424 --> 00:20:03.834
A fleeting hope that, by always
seeing him, she'd come to love him.

00:20:03.834 --> 00:20:07.034
I'm sorry! Please forgive me!

00:20:07.034 --> 00:20:09.564
I never meant to cause you any trouble!

00:20:10.344 --> 00:20:12.674
It's just... Just... I love you!

00:20:18.284 --> 00:20:19.274
I'm sorry.

00:20:20.214 --> 00:20:21.344
But...

00:20:41.804 --> 00:20:43.364
So long!

00:20:43.804 --> 00:20:44.844
Man...

00:20:44.844 --> 00:20:47.144
Even if he was a prince on a white horse...

00:20:47.144 --> 00:20:49.164
I don't want something like that!

00:20:49.714 --> 00:20:53.044
Miss, what did you tell him?

00:20:54.454 --> 00:20:57.414
Naomi, now I can paint my entry for the contest.

00:20:58.524 --> 00:21:01.144
Will you help me to finish it?

00:21:01.694 --> 00:21:02.584
Of course!

00:21:04.294 --> 00:21:05.354
Thank you.

00:21:05.694 --> 00:21:07.724
Naomi!

00:21:07.864 --> 00:21:09.024
Je t'aime!

00:21:12.504 --> 00:21:14.204
If you need a model, how about me?

00:21:14.204 --> 00:21:15.564
I'll help, too!

00:21:16.174 --> 00:21:18.674
I'm ready to strip, for the sake of art!

00:21:18.674 --> 00:21:20.244
You don't have to!

00:21:20.244 --> 00:21:23.844
What was that? You wanna
see me naked, Minamoto?

00:21:23.844 --> 00:21:24.914
Look! Look!

00:21:24.914 --> 00:21:25.844
Stop that!

00:21:28.584 --> 00:21:32.024
It's finished, Naomi. Thanks to you.

00:21:32.684 --> 00:21:35.244
You drew me so beautifully.

00:21:38.294 --> 00:21:41.424
I hope the contest goes well for you.

00:21:45.534 --> 00:21:46.394
Yes.

00:21:50.504 --> 00:21:52.734
Miss Ruriko... Take care.

00:21:54.114 --> 00:21:55.704
Take care.

00:22:04.484 --> 00:22:08.584
I wish I could have painted it
forever and never finished.

00:22:09.424 --> 00:22:11.554
The time we spent made me happy.

00:22:15.694 --> 00:22:17.794
Thank you, Naomi.

00:22:31.514 --> 00:22:36.254
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:36.254 --> 00:22:39.184
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:39.184 --> 00:22:41.554
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:41.554 --> 00:22:45.764
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru hito yo

00:22:45.764 --> 00:22:51.634
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:51.934 --> 00:22:56.934
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:56.934 --> 00:23:00.474
Darenimo makenai kara

00:23:00.474 --> 00:23:05.744
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:23:05.744 --> 00:23:10.954
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:10.954 --> 00:23:15.294
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:15.294 --> 00:23:20.934
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:20.934 --> 00:23:25.634
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:25.634 --> 00:23:31.974
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:31.974 --> 00:23:34.904
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:35.144 --> 00:23:40.814
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:50.794 --> 00:23:51.194
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:51.194 --> 00:23:52.024
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:52.024 --> 00:23:52.824
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:52.824 --> 00:23:54.964
Why can't I go in?

00:23:54.964 --> 00:23:57.464
I really wanted to eat a feast at the party.

00:23:57.464 --> 00:24:00.404
I guess we only rate getting instant ramen.

00:24:00.474 --> 00:24:01.804
Even if they are Level 7's,

00:24:01.804 --> 00:24:04.174
I won't knowingly send them on
a life-threatening mission!

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:06.244
Right. Nor should you.

00:24:06.244 --> 00:24:07.774
Hyobu! You!

00:24:07.774 --> 00:24:09.174
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:09.174 --> 00:24:12.344
Episode 37. "A Mighty Enemy
Attacks! Black Phantom"

00:24:12.344 --> 00:24:15.554
He and The Children must not be allowed
to fight, under any circumstances!

00:24:15.554 --> 00:24:16.714
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:16.714 --> 00:24:17.584
A Mighty Enemy Attacks!
Black Phantom
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:17.584 --> 00:24:20.054
A Mighty Enemy Attacks!
Black Phantom
